iec61850-interop iec61850-rust adapter
======================================

This directory (adapters/iec61850-rust/) and the image built from it,
ghcr.io/otfabric/iec61850-interop-iec61850-rust, link the iec61850-rust crates
(https://github.com/csp0924/iec61850-rust), Copyright (c) 2026 Cheng Sin
Pang, licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License 2.0 at your
option (LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE).

Pinned upstream: github.com/csp0924/iec61850-rust commit
d4e895217f367ed4caebf21611d2c16ee46035c0 (tag v0.2.0), the `rev` of the
git dependencies in Cargo.toml, locked in Cargo.lock. The crates are
fetched at that commit when the image is built; they are neither patched
nor vendored here.

The adapter code in this directory is MIT, like the rest of iec61850-interop.
